0be866787.mp4?t=1743906978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Appeal point<br>\u30fbA cute wizard animation has been added to the traditional clicker game style.<br>- Purchasing upgrades dramatically increases heart production<br>\u30fb Chance to get a lot of hearts in &quot;Fever Mode&quot;!<br>\u30fbLet's get &quot;Ultra Fever Mode&quot; where you can get more hearts!<br>\u30fbEquipped with a convenient system such as purchasing as much as you can, boosting productivity with selected animations, etc.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142540/extras/66f86f574adc9d229cd546c4e4e89da2.poster.avif?t=1743906978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142540/extras/66f86f574adc9d229cd546c4e4e89da2.webm?t=1743906978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142540/extras/66f86f574adc9d229cd546c4e4e89da2.mp4?t=1743906978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You can enjoy the traditional clicker game style and the cuteness of anime-style magical girls.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142540/extras/66240969dbda9d30080f1c9a0aa141d9.poster.avif?t=1743906978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142540/extras/66240969dbda9d30080f1c9a0aa141d9.webm?t=1743906978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142540/extras/66240969dbda9d30080f1c9a0aa141d9.mp4?t=1743906978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
